        "key": "D",
        "content": "They have the same perimeter.",
        "rationale": "The perimeter is multiplied by the scale factor."
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "In similar shapes the corresponding angles are equal and corresponding sides are in the same ratio (the scale factor). Sizes, areas and perimeters change unless the scale factor is 1.",
